# `* / %` at the walked root (FABLE-OPUS-ROOT-PUTOF-MUL-20260925-183 commit 2).  2 + 3 * 4 is 14
# (bit 1); a size_t %: 17U % 5U is 2U (bit 2); an int / with a negative operand: -7 / 2 is -3, as C
# (bit 4); a % after a *: 3 * 5 % 4 is 3, left to right (bit 8).  All: 15.
int: r 0
int: n 0
n: 0 - 7
size_t: s 17U
if: 2 + 3 * 4 = 14
    r: r + 1
if: s % 5U = 2U
    r: r + 2
if: n / 2 = 0 - 3
    r: r + 4
if: 3 * 5 % 4 = 3
    r: r + 8
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
